**Track D2 — implementation design** consumes this spec and produces the engineering plan: which Compose files change, how the existing `ui/theme/{Color, Type, Shape}.kt` are restructured, where derived tokens (soft variants) live, how `AgentExtraTypography` is exposed via a `CompositionLocal`, and how the four-duration / two-easing invariants are enforced (lint rule? convention review?).

