## 11. Open questions (none blocking)

- **Should the launcher icon foreground be the paw, or paw + claw mark?** Baseline says paw alone. Aligned spec defers to Phase 1 implementation — neither reviewer had a strong opinion.
- **Does Variable Fraunces ship the italic axis at the SemiBold weight we want?** If not, an additional `fraunces_italic_variable.ttf` is needed. Implementation concern, not design.
- **Settings section heads — Fraunces or Geist?** Aligned spec keeps Fraunces (one display accent on a daily surface). If first-week dogfood feedback says it feels too literary on a utility screen, swap to Geist SemiBold at `titleLarge`. Cheap to revisit.
